research/h15_arcface_alignment.py adapt InsightFace's face_align.py and
ArcFaceONNX.get_feat at revision 1480e705287bc5d59f923b46c260ec6e3e4150f6:
https://github.com/deepinsight/insightface/tree/1480e705287bc5d59f923b46c260ec6e3e4150f6/python-package/insightface
